.TH std::inplace_vector::end,std::inplace_vector::cend 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::inplace_vector::end,std::inplace_vector::cend \- std::inplace_vector::end,std::inplace_vector::cend

.SH Synopsis
constexpr iterator end() noexcept;              \fB(1)\fP (since C++26)
constexpr const_iterator end() const noexcept;  \fB(2)\fP (since C++26)
constexpr const_iterator cend() const noexcept; \fB(3)\fP (since C++26)

Returns an iterator to the element following the last element of the inplace_vector.

This element acts as a placeholder; attempting to access it results in undefined behavior.

range-begin-end.svg

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

Iterator to the element following the last element.

.SH Complexity

Constant.

